### BOCollections API — REST Client scratch file
### Usage: install "humao.rest-client" extension, then click "Send Request" above each call.

@base = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

# ─── Auth ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Register
# @name register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dev@test.com",
  "password": "password",
  "displayName": "Dev User"
}

###

### Login
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dev@test.com",
  "password": "password"
}

###

# ─── Collections ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List collections
GET {{base}}/collections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Create collection
POST {{base}}/collections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "My CDs",
  "description": "Rock and electronic",
  "primaryCategory": "AUDIO"
}

###

# ─── Scan ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Barcode lookup — book (ISBN-13)
GET {{base}}/scan/barcode/9780743273565
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Barcode lookup — vinyl UPC
GET {{base}}/scan/barcode/602547284914
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# ─── Thrift scan ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Thrift scan (replace imageBase64 with a real base64-encoded JPEG)
POST {{base}}/thrift/scan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imageBase64": "...",
  "imageMimeType": "image/jpeg",
  "collectionIds": []
}

###

# ─── Items ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Search items
GET {{base}}/items?q=abbey
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Actuator health
GET {{base}}/../actuator/health
